        "text": "#### [16] Broadcom Agrees to Lend Anthropic Up to $42 Billion for AI Infrastructure\n* **What is confirmed:** Anthropic’s IPO prospectus disclosures show chip manufacturer Broadcom has agreed to extend a convertible credit facility of up to $42 billion to Anthropic"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 663,
        "endIndex": 827,
        "text": "The loan is intended to finance approximately one-third of Anthropic’s $125.2 billion, five-year commitment to lease Tensor Processing Unit (TPU) compute capacity"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 829,
        "endIndex": 913,
        "text": "Broadcom acts simultaneously as custom hardware designer, lessor, and debt financier"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        2,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 915,
        "endIndex": 1045,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Broadcom retains the right to designate third-party financing partners to underwrite portion of the notes"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1047,
        "endIndex": 1201,
        "text": "Anthropic noted in its S-1 filing that Broadcom’s dual status as both vendor and lender creates potential conflicts of interest regarding compute access"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1203,
        "endIndex": 1278,
        "text": "No notes are expected to be sold prior to the completion of Anthropic's IPO"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0,
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1280,
