    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2192,
        "endIndex": 2304,
        "text": "* **Publication status:** **SUITABLE TODAY** — Highly relevant for a UK briefing ahead of tribunal proceedings"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2312,
        "endIndex": 2704,
        "text": "#### [4] OpenAI Senior Safety Leader David Robinson Resigns, Citing 'Broken' Culture\n* **What is confirmed:** David Robinson, a senior safety leader at OpenAI who spent 3.5 years at the company and oversaw safety transparency and system reports for 12 model launches, resigned and published an op-ed in *The Atlantic* on October 3, 2026, titled *\"I Quit OpenAI Because Its Culture Is Broken\"*"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2706,
        "endIndex": 2858,
        "text": "He warned that frontier AI labs are relying on dangerous \"trial-and-error\" approaches and prioritizing rapid release cycles over structural safety rigor"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        10,
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2860,
        "endIndex": 3055,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** OpenAI issued a counterstatement disputing Robinson's assessment, stating that it actively pauses model training or holds back releases when safety benchmarks are not met"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        11,
        12
