      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 3197,
        "endIndex": 3394,
        "text": "#### [3] Aleph Alpha Releases 'Kolibri', a 78B Open-Weight Sovereign AI Model\n* **What is confirmed:** German AI firm Aleph Alpha released *Kolibri-1* under an Apache 2.0 license on October 3, 2026"
