        "endIndex": 4374,
        "text": "#### [7] Toshiba to Double AI Data Center Hard Drive Production by FY2027\n* **What is confirmed:** Toshiba Information Equipment (Philippines) and Nikkei Asia confirmed on October 2, 2026, that Toshiba is investing ¥60 billion (~$380 million) to double its output of high-capacity hard disk drives (HDDs) for AI data centers by FY2027 compared to FY2025"
