        "endIndex": 5171,
        "text": "#### [10] Google Suspends Product Bug Bounty Submissions to OSS VRP Due to 'AI Slop'\n* **What is confirmed:** Google officially suspended product vulnerability report submissions to its Open Source Software Vulnerability Reward Program (OSS VRP) on October 1, 2026"
